    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Located on the former grounds of Castleknock College this superbly decorated second floor three bedroomed apartment has the added benefit of two balconies and a southerly aspect to the rear. This exceptionally bright apartment is decorated to showhouse standards with high quality extras throughout including solid wood floors, additional fitted wardrobes and offers the intending purchaser modern design and spacious well proportioned rooms throughout. Collegewood is a prime residential well maintained location with all amenities within a short stroll including Castleknock Village, bus links, Castleknock Rail Station, the Phoenix Park and quality primary and secondary schools, all easily accessible by pedestrian walkway via College Grove.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended & by appointment only"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:\twith storage cupboard, hotpress, intercom and alarm control panel\r\n\r\nLounge:  with attractive marble fireplace, gas fire, TV point and patio doors to front balcony \r\n6.8x6.4m \t\r\n\t\r\nKitchen:  \tmodern fitted kitchen with wall and floor mounted units, tiled splash-back, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher, oven and hob, integrated spotlights\r\n3.1x2.3m\t\t\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: with built in wardrobes and patio door to south facing balcony \r\n4.4x3.7m\t \r\n\r\nEnsuite:  with shower, W.C and W.H.B, partially tiled walls \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: with built in wardrobes \r\n4.2x4.3m\t\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: with built in wardrobes \r\n4.1x2.4m\r\n\r\nBathroom:  with bath, W.C and W.H.B, partially tiled walls"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Outside\r\n\r\nTwo large private balcony areas, one with south facing aspect \r\nLandscaped common areas incorporating mature green with trees and shrubs \r\nOne car-parking space \r\n\r\n\r\nServices\r\n\r\nGFCH\r\nWired for alarm\r\nWooden double glazed windows\r\nVideo intercom system \r\nAnnual service charge €\r\n\r\nLocal Area Information\r\nPublic transport routes that service Collegewood, Castleknock:\r\nBus: 37/38\r\nRail: Castleknock Rail Station\r\nNearby Areas: Castleknock Village, Phoenix Park and Blanchardstown Centre"
      },
      {
